anahi.edit:
EDIT THE ATTACHED SPRITE SHEET. Keep Anahi's exact identity, nine poses in a single horizontal row, white open lab coat, green dress, brown belt with orange buckle, auburn hair in a round top bun, brown boots, magenta background. REDRAW AT A MUCH COARSER TRUE GAME BOY ADVANCE PIXEL RESOLUTION. The existing figures contain about 35 pixels vertically and are too thin: we need each COMPLETE figure built from EXACTLY 21 chunky square pixel rows and about 14 pixel columns, bun included. This is pixel art at literal 14x21 character resolution, no smaller subpixels. Think of a real very compact Emerald overworld NPC, not a miniaturized detailed illustration.

Important pixel anatomy budget: 3 rows for small round bun with dark band, 7 rows for a wide round main head, 8 rows for short white coat/green dress torso, 3 rows for boots and legs = 21 rows total. Big wide chibi head, short squat torso, short legs. Front head about 12 pixels wide; face about 6 pixels wide, with TWO clearly separated BLACK SINGLE-PIXEL EYES, each eye is a full native pixel. Need readable eyes even at tiny scale! Strong dark outline a full native pixel wide (roughly twice as thick as current outline relative to character height), continuous all around head, coat, arms, hands, boots. The bun must stay compact at 3 pixels high.

If output enlarged, EVERY native pixel is a perfectly flat solid large square (about 18 or more image pixels). No fine texture, no little hair streaks, no subpixel dots, no high-detail highlight clusters, no soft brushwork. Hair has just 3 colors, skin 2, coat 3, green dress 3, brown accessories 2 plus dark outline, magenta bg. Do not try to preserve the detailed pixel density of input.

Layout: exactly NINE complete sprites across one row, evenly spaced, centered within equal 16x32 logical cells. Empty MAGENTA above each character for the first 10 native rows. Body from local y=10 to30, empty magenta row31. No text, borders or guides.
LEFT TO RIGHT:
1 down standing, feet together;
2 up standing, full back, no face;
3 LEFT profile standing, nose toward left;
4 down walk with left leg advanced and right arm advanced;
5 down walk with right leg advanced and left arm advanced;
6 up walk left step;
7 up walk right step;
8 LEFT walking step A;
9 LEFT walking step B with opposite leg and arm advanced. Left frames must have different boot shapes, not just different arm poses.
Do not face right. No ground shadow.

Exact palette: #FF00FF background; #1A0D12 outline; hair #4A2124 #7F3C30 #B95737; skin #FFD3AB #E09669; coat #F8F8FC #D4D4E2 #9197B8; dress #2A4C29 #527A35 #7EA649; belt boots #6E3521 #C16237. Uniform flat magenta background, never transparent. The final native deliverable is 144x32, these macro-pixel figures must remain immediately readable at 14x21.
